WEBVTT

00:08.820 --> 00:10.700
Boy, I have a favor to ask.

00:13.300 --> 00:14.530
I wish to work.

00:14.530 --> 00:17.490
You want to... work?!

00:17.490 --> 00:21.570
I cannot simply remain here 
as a freeloader any longer!

00:21.570 --> 00:23.120
What brought this on?

00:23.120 --> 00:24.560
I'm sure you know

00:24.560 --> 00:28.630
that every time Teal visits 
me, she brings me magicite.

00:29.170 --> 00:31.620
Here you go, guardian deity!

00:32.510 --> 00:36.410
Just how much of her paycheck 
is she spending on me?

00:36.410 --> 00:38.760
So you don't want to be a gigolo anymore.

00:38.760 --> 00:40.030
Please.

00:42.130 --> 00:44.100
Well, it seems like you're 
prepared for this.

00:44.810 --> 00:46.560
Okay, then, let's begin...

00:46.560 --> 00:49.030
Gar's great reformation!

02:21.460 --> 02:25.130
I am Gar. I wish to 
register as an adventurer.

02:25.130 --> 02:27.250
Will this suffice for my paperwork?

02:27.470 --> 02:29.500
U-Um...

02:29.500 --> 02:32.420
This is a friend of the Magic 
Swordsman of Black Lightning.

02:32.420 --> 02:36.340
He may look a bit shady, 
but he can be trusted.

02:37.290 --> 02:40.300
Kramen! Kramen!

02:40.980 --> 02:43.640
What is it? I'm busy, you know.

02:43.640 --> 02:45.510
Don't bother lying!

02:45.510 --> 02:49.270
I know you were just admiring the lunch 
your wife packed for you and grinning!

02:49.270 --> 02:51.560
Hey! Not so loud!

02:54.980 --> 02:58.030
I can't be bothered to comment on this 
spectacle, so I'll just ask.

02:58.030 --> 02:58.990
So what's up?

02:59.350 --> 03:01.490
I wish to register as an adventurer.

03:02.670 --> 03:03.640
Okay.

03:03.640 --> 03:05.040
That's okay?!

03:05.040 --> 03:07.430
The Magic Swordsman here 
will be responsible for him.

03:07.430 --> 03:09.500
Indeed! I guarantee it!

03:10.180 --> 03:12.100
There you go. You're registered.

03:12.750 --> 03:13.940
I thank you.

03:13.940 --> 03:16.610
Now, we will return tomorrow 
to accept a quest.

03:16.610 --> 03:19.340
Find us one that you deem 
suitable for a beginner.

03:19.660 --> 03:20.740
Farewell!

03:23.970 --> 03:26.280
Why did we not accept a quest today?

03:26.280 --> 03:28.020
You need to prepare a weapon and stuff.

03:28.020 --> 03:29.700
I can use my magic—

03:29.700 --> 03:30.750
Oh.

03:30.750 --> 03:32.200
Exactly.

03:32.200 --> 03:35.140
The moment you use dark magic, 
everyone will know you're a demon.

03:35.140 --> 03:36.440
You gotta be careful.

03:36.860 --> 03:39.600
Also, you don't know anything 
about Minerva, right?

03:39.600 --> 03:41.450
I'll spend today showing you around.

03:41.810 --> 03:43.110
I appreciate the trouble.

03:43.110 --> 03:45.660
What are you talking about? You're...

03:45.890 --> 03:49.470
going to be the Magic Swordsman 
of Black Lightning's partner!

03:49.470 --> 03:51.160
I would rather not.

03:53.920 --> 03:55.320
We're here to take a quest!

03:55.320 --> 03:57.290
Must you be so loud first 
thing in the morning?

03:57.290 --> 04:00.050
Oh, someone's here looking for you.

04:00.430 --> 04:02.750
For the Magic Swordsman 
of Black Lightning?

04:02.750 --> 04:03.930
Has something happened?

04:04.330 --> 04:06.390
She's waiting behind the guild.

04:06.390 --> 04:07.960
Don't make her wait too long.

04:09.830 --> 04:11.300
I've been waiting for you...

04:12.450 --> 04:15.220
Magic Swordsman of Black Lightning.

04:16.010 --> 04:17.400
Cecilia?!

04:17.400 --> 04:19.530
So it really is you, Yoki!

04:19.530 --> 04:20.530
Huh?!

04:20.530 --> 04:23.110
N-No, this is, um... How do I put it...

04:23.530 --> 04:27.530
My name is not Yoki! It is "Magic 
Swordsman of Black Lightning"!

04:27.530 --> 04:29.290
Yoki.

04:29.980 --> 04:33.540
I'm sorry. I know what 
I'm doing is stupid.

04:33.540 --> 04:34.940
You do?

04:34.940 --> 04:36.790
But how did you know?

04:36.790 --> 04:39.450
Sophia told me.

04:39.960 --> 04:43.420
She said the Magic Swordsman of 
Black Lightning showed up again.

04:44.040 --> 04:46.430
I had heard rumors about him before,

04:46.730 --> 04:50.930
but the more I heard, the 
more it sounded like you.

04:51.370 --> 04:55.980
I was worried some kind of uproar 
might ensue, so I came to find out.

04:55.980 --> 04:58.550
Kramen leaked my identity, didn't he?

05:00.710 --> 05:03.070
So that's what's going on!

05:03.070 --> 05:07.700
Are you dressed as the Magic Swordsman 
so that Gar won't be conspicuous?

05:07.700 --> 05:09.530
Yeah, something like that!

05:09.530 --> 05:12.220
According to my plans, this 
look is the way to go!

05:12.630 --> 05:14.290
I'll help, too.

05:14.290 --> 05:15.080
Huh?!

05:15.080 --> 05:17.910
I'd be too worried to let 
you handle this alone.

05:18.420 --> 05:19.210
Right...

05:19.610 --> 05:22.790
Now, let's start with a 
beginner-friendly quest.

05:24.620 --> 05:27.610
We are here from the adventurers' guild 
about the quest to find your pet!

05:27.610 --> 05:29.110
Tell us your story!

05:30.190 --> 05:34.140
Hey. The clients appear to have frozen.

05:34.490 --> 05:37.250
Hah! I guess they were 
captivated by my appearance.

05:37.250 --> 05:41.110
Magic Swordsman, would you please 
keep your mouth shut for the moment?

05:42.360 --> 05:45.680
For starters, please tell us 
how we can identify your cat.

05:45.680 --> 05:49.110
Can you describe its color, 
size, and tail shape?

05:51.120 --> 05:53.530
He's taking care to watch and learn.

06:00.860 --> 06:03.780
This is the description 
of their missing kitten.

06:03.780 --> 06:07.950
It's very clever and always came 
back home after going outside,

06:07.950 --> 06:10.740
but this time, it's been
missing since last week.

06:10.740 --> 06:12.540
How shall we search for it?

06:12.540 --> 06:14.470
We should start by asking around.

06:14.470 --> 06:19.090
It's standard practice to ask the 
neighbors and any patrolling knights.

06:19.090 --> 06:20.250
However...

06:20.250 --> 06:22.480
I will go above and beyond that!

06:22.480 --> 06:23.250
Hup!

06:25.690 --> 06:29.860
My enhanced sense of smell picked 
up the cat's scent from its owners!

06:29.860 --> 06:32.480
And now I'll use Instant 
Lightning to run faster

06:32.480 --> 06:35.060
and run all over town 
looking for that cat!

06:41.050 --> 06:42.250
I found you.

06:44.020 --> 06:49.000
Hah! You've instinctively sensed 
my strength and put up your guard?

06:49.000 --> 06:52.760
Relax. The Magic Swordsman of 
Black Lightning is your friend.

06:54.510 --> 06:57.060
I see I have no choice 
but to put you to sleep.

06:57.060 --> 06:58.260
Holy Bell.

07:07.320 --> 07:09.150
Thank you so much!

07:09.610 --> 07:11.470
But... where'd this cat come from?

07:11.470 --> 07:13.250
It was with your cat.

07:13.250 --> 07:17.450
I've healed its wounds, so please 
look after it as well, if you can.

07:17.450 --> 07:19.200
Now, farewell!

07:20.230 --> 07:22.170
So our quest is complete now?

07:22.170 --> 07:22.900
Yes.

07:23.370 --> 07:26.760
Now we just need to inform the 
guild that we've finished it,

07:26.760 --> 07:28.590
and we'll receive our reward money.

07:28.590 --> 07:29.840
I see.

07:29.840 --> 07:32.110
All right! On to the next quest!

07:32.110 --> 07:33.180
Wait a minute!

07:33.180 --> 07:36.640
No one can do things the way 
you do, Magic Swordsman.

07:36.640 --> 07:39.310
This won't give Gar any experience.

07:40.760 --> 07:41.640
Sorry.

07:41.640 --> 07:43.910
This time, we'll put Gar up front

07:43.910 --> 07:46.490
and have him do as much 
as he can on his own.

07:46.490 --> 07:50.030
A-All right. But I will still 
depend on you to show me the way.

07:50.030 --> 07:51.290
I don't know the land.

07:51.290 --> 07:53.450
You have nothing to worry about!

07:53.450 --> 07:58.090
You have me, the Magic Swordsman 
of Black Lightning, behind you!

08:00.970 --> 08:02.500
This must be the herb.

08:02.500 --> 08:03.460
Listen up, Gar.

08:04.060 --> 08:07.410
Gathering herbs is a path all 
adventurers must walk at some point.

08:07.410 --> 08:09.270
Don't take any more than you need,

08:09.270 --> 08:11.430
or there won't be enough left for others.

08:11.430 --> 08:13.340
Yes, I understand.

08:14.040 --> 08:15.840
Will this suffice?

08:15.840 --> 08:17.700
Yeah, looks good.

08:17.700 --> 08:21.190
Now you, too, have taken a step 
toward even greater heigh—

08:20.270 --> 08:22.350
Good. Let's move on to the next quest.

08:23.770 --> 08:26.340
The next quest is taking out some goblins.

08:26.700 --> 08:30.010
This will probably be Gar's first battle.

08:30.010 --> 08:31.860
We'll have to support him...

08:35.580 --> 08:37.920
I don't think there'll 
be any need for that.

08:37.920 --> 08:39.810
It's all thanks to the power of love!

08:39.810 --> 08:42.180
I mean, the power of 
escaping the gigolo life!

08:42.180 --> 08:43.410
I'm not a gigolo!

08:44.770 --> 08:47.000
Yep, you've completed 
the quest, all right.

08:47.780 --> 08:49.100
Here's your reward.

08:53.830 --> 08:56.760
So this is what it means to work.

08:57.470 --> 08:59.830
Teal has been working all this time

08:59.830 --> 09:03.090
and making money, despite 
her weak constitution...

09:03.640 --> 09:05.870
I will work even more!

09:05.870 --> 09:08.900
And I will repay the debt I owe Teal!

09:08.900 --> 09:09.940
That's the spirit!

09:09.940 --> 09:11.810
We're rooting for you, Gar!

09:11.810 --> 09:14.340
We'll back you up with all 
we've got tomorrow, too!

09:14.340 --> 09:17.960
I'm sorry, but could you allow 
me to do this myself from now on?

09:17.960 --> 09:18.500
What?!

09:18.500 --> 09:19.970
But it's too soon for you to...

09:19.970 --> 09:23.110
Don't worry. I won't cause any problems.

09:23.110 --> 09:26.050
I have a good idea of how 
to carry out quests now.

09:28.170 --> 09:30.380
You'd better come back strong enough

09:30.380 --> 09:34.940
to be the Magic Swordsman of 
Black Lightning's right-hand man!

09:34.940 --> 09:37.050
I'll be looking forward to your return!

09:38.770 --> 09:40.840
Anyway, the sun's going down.

09:40.840 --> 09:42.390
Time to part ways for now.

09:42.390 --> 09:44.600
Do you have plans after this?

09:44.600 --> 09:47.590
Since I'm the Magic Swordsman 
of Black Lightning now,

09:47.590 --> 09:49.520
I'm going on a Rank A quest.

09:51.710 --> 09:52.840
I'll go with you.

09:52.840 --> 09:53.690
Wut?!

09:53.910 --> 09:59.370
But, um... most Rank A quests 
require a few days' travel time.

09:59.370 --> 10:01.870
And you're, well... busy, aren't you?

10:02.370 --> 10:04.200
That's not a problem right now!

10:04.200 --> 10:07.460
Or... would I be a burden?

10:07.460 --> 10:08.990
Of course I'd be happy to have you!

10:09.460 --> 10:12.710
But this won't be so much 
a quest as a journey!

10:13.000 --> 10:15.340
Before now, we've had tea together

10:15.340 --> 10:17.300
and traveled with friends, but...

10:17.300 --> 10:18.970
several days of just the two of us?!

10:18.970 --> 10:22.990
B-But you'd be uncomfortable 
camping out in those clothes.

10:22.990 --> 10:25.130
And you don't have gear 
for long journeys, do you?

10:25.130 --> 10:26.220
Very well.

10:26.470 --> 10:28.730
Then please wait here for a little while.

10:28.730 --> 10:29.460
Huh?

10:36.310 --> 10:37.690
Sorry I kept you waiting!

10:43.750 --> 10:45.660
Cecily the adventurer at your service!

10:46.120 --> 10:47.080
Cecily?

10:47.080 --> 10:49.460
I'm all set for a long journey now,

10:49.460 --> 10:53.290
and in this outfit, no one will know 
I'm Cecilia from the hero's party.

10:53.660 --> 10:55.670
So now there's no problem, right?

10:59.560 --> 11:02.020
Kramen sure was happy, wasn't he?

11:02.430 --> 11:05.780
He said we were taking care of a 
real pain-in-the-ass quest for him,

11:05.780 --> 11:07.560
but we're just inspecting some ruins.

11:07.560 --> 11:09.060
How hard can that be?

11:09.060 --> 11:13.270
Rank A quests aren't just about 
fighting strong monsters.

11:13.670 --> 11:17.980
Also, there are no villages we can 
rest in on the way to these ruins.

11:17.980 --> 11:20.820
Yeah, and no real road, 
either. Kinda inconvenient.

11:20.820 --> 11:24.410
Verifying our route to the 
ruins will be dangerous.

11:24.410 --> 11:27.730
On top of that, we have to search 
inside without ransacking them.

11:28.170 --> 11:31.750
Assume we won't be able to use 
attack magic as a general rule.

11:31.750 --> 11:33.740
But what if monsters show up?

11:33.740 --> 11:35.930
We do everything we can to avoid combat.

11:35.930 --> 11:39.000
Studying the monsters that live 
in the ruins is part of the quest.

11:39.000 --> 11:40.970
They're sure asking a lot...

11:40.970 --> 11:44.620
The client is an archaeologist 
from a research institution.

11:44.620 --> 11:47.500
This quest is probably very 
important to the guild.

11:47.500 --> 11:50.310
They must really trust 
you, Magic Swordsman.

11:50.310 --> 11:52.110
Well, I'll have to give it my all, then.

11:54.330 --> 11:56.840
Shall we start preparing to make camp?

12:07.250 --> 12:08.680
We're camping out together!

12:08.680 --> 12:11.120
We're spending the night alone together!

12:11.480 --> 12:15.790
Any other time, I'd probably 
panic and get all nervous,

12:15.790 --> 12:17.690
but now, it's no problem!

12:17.690 --> 12:18.590
Because...

12:18.890 --> 12:22.590
I can play it all off by 
going into chuuni mode!

12:23.690 --> 12:25.720
I am the Magic Swordsman 
of Black Lightning.

12:25.720 --> 12:28.490
I will make even camping out 
a comfortable experience!

12:31.480 --> 12:33.960
I've assured that our 
surroundings are safe.

12:33.960 --> 12:34.730
And...

12:34.730 --> 12:38.230
I've gathered fruits and vegetables 
for our rations, as well!

12:38.230 --> 12:40.730
You certainly are efficient.

12:41.190 --> 12:44.740
No one else is around. Why 
don't you take the mask off?

12:44.740 --> 12:46.440
That I cannot do!

12:46.440 --> 12:49.700
Until this quest is over, I am the 
Magic Swordsman of Black Lightning!

12:49.700 --> 12:51.550
To show my true identity 
would be inexcusable!

12:51.550 --> 12:52.620
Incidentally...

12:54.500 --> 12:57.530
I've made it so I can 
still eat with it on!

12:58.000 --> 12:59.630
That's bad manners!

13:00.750 --> 13:02.710
I'm sorry! I'll take it off!

13:07.850 --> 13:10.010
Well, then, I'll dish up the soup.

13:20.130 --> 13:22.900
Here you go. It's very simple, but...

13:22.900 --> 13:24.030
Thanks.

13:28.360 --> 13:29.610
That's good!

13:29.610 --> 13:32.540
I mean, there's no way anything 
you cook wouldn't be good!

13:33.550 --> 13:34.940
You're exaggerating.

13:37.170 --> 13:39.330
I-It's the truth!

13:42.370 --> 13:44.300
Thanks for dinner! Mask on!

13:45.700 --> 13:47.460
Be still, my soul!

13:47.460 --> 13:49.180
You seem quite flustered to me!

13:49.180 --> 13:51.980
R-Really? Well... that won't do!

13:51.980 --> 13:53.930
We should sleep for 
our early start tomorrow!

13:54.600 --> 13:56.420
You want to go to sleep already?

13:56.420 --> 13:58.420
She's so cute!

13:58.420 --> 14:02.690
But... somehow, she seems 
different from usual today.

14:02.690 --> 14:04.050
But Cecilia, you—

14:04.050 --> 14:05.140
It's Cecily!

14:05.460 --> 14:10.060
Sorry. You've been questing since this 
morning, Cecily. You must be tired.

14:11.380 --> 14:13.950
Just who do you think I am?

14:14.190 --> 14:16.940
I have completed more quests 
than you, Magic Swordsman.

14:16.940 --> 14:18.930
I am one of those chosen 
to slay the Demon King

14:18.930 --> 14:20.980
as a member of the hero's party!

14:21.460 --> 14:24.640
I was just trying to imitate you.

14:24.640 --> 14:26.460
That freaked me out...

14:35.490 --> 14:39.980
I'm sorry to go against your 
wishes, but I must refuse.

14:39.980 --> 14:42.050
I am still inexperienced.

14:42.500 --> 14:45.150
I have no intention of marrying anyone.

14:45.730 --> 14:49.860
What, so that funny guy dumped you, then?

14:49.860 --> 14:52.120
He has nothing to do with this!

14:52.120 --> 14:53.150
Uh-huh.

14:53.740 --> 14:56.870
But this is not a man you can 
turn down for a reason like that.

14:57.240 --> 14:59.690
The heir to an influential 
neighboring domain lord

14:59.690 --> 15:02.750
has requested your hand in marriage.

15:11.760 --> 15:13.770
Now, let us away, Cecily!

15:13.770 --> 15:16.250
An adventure yet unseen awaits us!

15:16.250 --> 15:19.080
You mustn't yell so 
loudly, Magic Swordsman.

15:19.080 --> 15:21.330
If there are monsters nearby, 
you'll provoke them.

15:21.330 --> 15:22.510
Sorry.

15:28.530 --> 15:31.250
I'll take the front line today.

15:31.250 --> 15:33.280
Huh? Shouldn't it be the other way around?

15:33.280 --> 15:37.600
Your magic is powerful. 
It could damage the ruins.

15:37.600 --> 15:41.540
I can restrain monsters with 
Saint Chains if necessary.

15:41.540 --> 15:43.850
No, let me handle this.

15:43.850 --> 15:46.430
I can tell where monsters are.

15:46.430 --> 15:49.800
Plus, I still have plenty of 
magic I haven't shown you yet.

15:59.800 --> 16:01.670
There are monsters up ahead.

16:01.670 --> 16:03.470
Around thirteen of them.

16:03.470 --> 16:04.270
What?

16:11.490 --> 16:14.260
Incredible! You even got the number right!

16:14.260 --> 16:17.160
But there are too many 
for me to restrain them.

16:17.640 --> 16:20.630
I want to avoid combat whenever 
possible, so let's go around.

16:21.250 --> 16:24.500
No. Leave this to me.

16:25.290 --> 16:26.630
Illusion Sphere.

16:34.680 --> 16:36.870
I can't see anything...

16:36.870 --> 16:39.660
We're going to keep moving. 
Keep your eyes shut.

16:46.030 --> 16:49.110
So... what kind of spell did you use?

16:49.560 --> 16:53.020
An intermediate dark spell 
called Illusion Sphere.

16:53.020 --> 16:54.740
It shows targets an illusion.

16:54.970 --> 16:58.810
When they look at it, they see the 
one thing they find most attractive

16:58.810 --> 17:00.410
and can't tear their eyes away.

17:00.410 --> 17:01.710
Attractive?

17:01.710 --> 17:03.250
The thing they like most, basically.

17:04.110 --> 17:05.000
In my case...

17:05.750 --> 17:08.110
I'd see Cecilia. No doubt.

17:08.840 --> 17:10.750
And Raven would see Happiness.

17:10.750 --> 17:13.260
I wonder what I'd see if I looked at it.

17:13.260 --> 17:16.430
Well... it'd be whatever 
you like the most...

17:17.800 --> 17:19.260
In that case...

17:23.270 --> 17:25.020
I guess it'd be cake!

17:25.020 --> 17:26.410
That's where you went?!

17:26.410 --> 17:27.730
I mean, uh... n-nothing!

17:28.200 --> 17:30.070
That's a convenient spell.

17:30.070 --> 17:32.980
It's amazing how many different 
types of spells you have.

17:34.330 --> 17:36.490
That's not all there is to my magic!

17:36.490 --> 17:38.950
Just follow me, and you 
needn't worry about a thing!

17:51.840 --> 17:54.360
It looks like this is where the ruins end.

17:55.180 --> 17:59.430
Cecily... is it normal for ruins 
to be so full of nothing?!

17:59.430 --> 18:01.800
Well, there is an unusual mushroom.

18:02.680 --> 18:03.920
No matter how far we go,

18:03.920 --> 18:06.690
it's just monsters, plants, 
monsters, plants, and mushrooms!

18:06.690 --> 18:08.650
There's gotta be more to it than this!

18:08.650 --> 18:10.650
Like an android 
dormant for millennia,

18:10.650 --> 18:13.590
a sealed magic sword, relics, treasures...

18:13.590 --> 18:15.460
I'll even take the most 
clichéd boss monster!

18:15.460 --> 18:17.110
Just give me something!

18:17.110 --> 18:18.970
Not so loud!

18:18.970 --> 18:20.170
R-Right...

18:20.620 --> 18:23.370
All right, let's head outside.

18:33.850 --> 18:35.390
This is amazing.

18:37.590 --> 18:38.670
Okay.

18:38.670 --> 18:40.580
I guess that's the end of that quest.

18:40.580 --> 18:44.060
It'll be nighttime soon. Let's 
camp where we did last night.

18:44.060 --> 18:45.310
R-Right...

18:45.590 --> 18:47.310
Just the two of us again...

18:47.310 --> 18:50.590
I definitely can't take off the mask now!

18:54.350 --> 18:56.070
The quest is complete!

18:56.380 --> 18:58.220
For the Magic Swordsman of Black Lightning

18:58.220 --> 19:02.540
and Cecily, the Guide of Love 
and Mercy, it was no prob—

19:02.540 --> 19:03.110
Ow!

19:03.110 --> 19:05.200
I don't need a nickname.

19:05.200 --> 19:06.980
But it's so cool...

19:06.980 --> 19:08.960
And? Anything to report?

19:10.120 --> 19:10.960
Here you are.

19:11.490 --> 19:13.400
A... written report?

19:13.830 --> 19:16.190
Wow, this is fantastic!

19:16.190 --> 19:18.670
Isn't a verbal report enough?

19:18.670 --> 19:21.080
That kind of laziness is exactly why

19:21.080 --> 19:23.790
I can't give a quest like 
this to just anyone.

19:23.790 --> 19:27.040
That's milady—I mean, Cecily for you!

19:27.040 --> 19:30.230
I can submit this as is, 
so it's a huge help!

19:30.940 --> 19:32.190
Here's your reward.

19:32.190 --> 19:35.170
That's Rank A for you. The reward's huge.

19:35.170 --> 19:37.510
Let's use it to throw a big after-party!

19:37.510 --> 19:40.150
That sounds great! But first...

19:42.160 --> 19:44.110
you should change clothes.

19:44.110 --> 19:44.660
Huh?

19:47.160 --> 19:49.540
Hm? It's unlocked?

19:58.500 --> 20:02.050
Where is the guardian deity?

20:04.510 --> 20:08.100
I've been coming here every 
day for the past four days,

20:08.100 --> 20:10.100
and he isn't here.

20:10.410 --> 20:14.790
I beg of you... if you know 
where he is, please tell me.

20:14.790 --> 20:17.150
Where has the guardian deity gone?

20:17.940 --> 20:19.930
Ah, boy, you've returned.

20:19.930 --> 20:20.860
Gar!

20:20.860 --> 20:24.700
That voice... The guardian deity?

20:25.050 --> 20:26.910
Yes. It's me.

20:29.160 --> 20:33.040
Guardian deity!

20:36.040 --> 20:39.820
You were away for so long! 
I was worried about you!

20:39.820 --> 20:42.030
I'm sorry I didn't inform you.

20:42.030 --> 20:44.550
The truth is, I've rented 
a room near here.

20:46.050 --> 20:48.580
I've become an adventurer.

20:48.580 --> 20:50.810
I can make my own living now.

20:50.810 --> 20:54.840
So you no longer need to overtax 
yourself to buy me magicite.

20:53.970 --> 20:55.440
I'm not overtaxing myself!

20:55.750 --> 21:00.170
Serving you is my greatest 
happiness in life!

21:00.170 --> 21:02.840
Please let me continue to serve you!

21:03.380 --> 21:04.820
Very well.

21:06.320 --> 21:08.070
Thank you!

21:08.070 --> 21:11.170
But I will still repay my debt to you.

21:11.170 --> 21:15.210
But there's no need! As long 
as I'm by your side, I'm happy!

21:15.450 --> 21:18.210
Um... we're still here, you know...

21:21.730 --> 21:25.910
Teal didn't say a word about 
the Magic Swordsman and Cecily.

21:25.910 --> 21:27.970
She only had eyes for Gar.

21:28.630 --> 21:31.340
Man, for some reason, I'm exhausted.

21:38.550 --> 21:39.590
Yoki?!

21:39.590 --> 21:40.780
I-I'm done for!

21:40.780 --> 21:44.360
Four days' worth of embarrassment 
just hits too hard!

21:44.780 --> 21:46.740
I'm sealing this away!

21:46.740 --> 21:47.860
Wait, please!

21:49.270 --> 21:52.460
It's true that the Magic 
Swordsman is out of control,

21:52.460 --> 21:54.670
he draws a lot of negative attention,

21:54.670 --> 21:56.830
and he causes trouble 
more often than not...

21:57.230 --> 22:01.740
But we came through this quest 
in one piece thanks to his magic.

22:03.300 --> 22:07.680
Cecily the adventurer would be 
happy to team up with him again.

22:10.630 --> 22:15.670
Well, Adventurer Cecily, there's 
still much more to my magic!

22:15.670 --> 22:17.310
If you've taken an interest,

22:17.310 --> 22:21.190
I will show you even greater 
power on our next quest!

22:22.350 --> 22:24.110
I look forward to it!
